OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few isolated light showers
OL,6,Fearly and in the west, but most
OL,7,Fstaying dry, with best of the
OL,8,Fafternoon highs in the east. West to
OL,9,Fsouthwest breezes.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThickening cloud heralding
OL,12,Fperiods of rain that reach the western
OL,13,Fcoast late evening, before following
OL,14,Fto all overnight with heavier
OL,15,Foutbreaks in west and strengthening
OL,16,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
